  <div class="prose prose-purple max-w-none text-gray-600 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
    <header>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1F2937] mb-2">⚖️ Bible Sketch: Terms of Service</h1>
