    <hr />

    <section>
      <h2>1. Scope of Service</h2>
      <p>By using Bible Sketch, you agree that you are at least 18 years old, or a parent or guardian consenting on behalf of a minor who is at least 13. Children under 13 may not create an account.</p>
      <h3>1.1. Defined Artistic Scope</h3>
      <p>Bible Sketch is a specialized tool for creating Christian coloring pages from Bible verses, in the styles offered in the app. Currently these are:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Scene Art</strong>, illustrated scenes in six styles: Sunday School, Stained Glass, Iconography, Comic Book, Classic, and Doodles.</li>
        <li><strong>Verse Art</strong>, decorative lettering of a verse in four styles: Elegant Script, Modern Brush, Playful, and Classic Serif.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Any attempt to force the service to generate photorealistic imagery, non-biblical content, or content outside these parameters is a violation of these terms and is not supported.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Intellectual Property &amp; Rights</h2>
      <h3>2.1. User Ownership</h3>
      <p>As between you and Bible Sketch, <strong>you own the images you generate</strong> on the platform. We assign to you all rights, title, and interest in the assets you create, subject to your compliance with these Terms. You are free to print, sell, or distribute your generated images commercially.</p>
